		ZH 1:
		'Annis made a truly pitiful'
		R
		'face. Chizuko felt superior'
		R
		'and smiled with satisfaction.'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_061da:
		ZH 1:
		'Heheh...'
		R
		'I’m sure a complete screw-up'
		R
		'like you would give the'
		R
		'military problems, too...'
		\L_062ff:
		ZH 1:
		'This is an important political'
		R
		'time, so wait here.'
		R
		'My reputation would drop if I'
		R
		'let an idiot go unchecked.'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_0624a:
		ZH 1:
		'Ah... Thank you so much, I’ll'
		R
		'stay here!'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_061f6:
		ZH 1:
		'She’s an idiot, but she’s'
		R
		'endowed with a lot of power...'
		\L_062ff:
		ZH 1:
		'If it came down to it, she can'
		R
		'be used as an ingredient for'
		R
		'the Flash, so I should keep'
		R
		'her on hand.'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_061da:
		ZH 1:
		'Huhuhu, huhuhuhu...'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_0624a:
		ZH 1:
		'Ahaha, ahahahaha.'
		R
		'Ahahahahahahahaha.'
		R
		'This is fun, Lord Chizuko.'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_061da:
		ZH 1:
		'You don’t need to laugh!'
		R
		'If you’ve got time to laugh'
		R
		'then do your job! How long are'
		R
		'you going to stand here?!!'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
		\L_0624a:
		ZH 1:
		'Oooookay!'
		\L_062ff:
		\L_062f2:
	}
